- content_for :og_image, asset_url('stl-greg.png')

= render 'shared/fun_stuff_page', page_title: 'STLs & Mounts', current_page: 'STLs & Mounts', page_subtitle: '3D printable mounts and enclosures for Baldrick boards', document_title: 'STLs & Mounts - Fun Stuff', meta: ['Community designs', 'Free downloads', 'Printable STLs'], toc: stls_and_mounts_toc do
  p.lead We designed the Baldrick footprint to be compatible with common smart receiver mounts — but our community has gone further.

  .prose
    p That hasn't stopped our incredible friends and customers from building their own mounts, and with their permission, some of them are here to download.

    .callout.info
      span.ic
        svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"
          circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"
          path d="M12 16v-4M12 8h.01"
      div
        span.lbl Community contributions
        p.bd These mounts have been designed and shared by our amazing community members. Thank you to all the contributors!

    section#small
      h2
        span.hk
          span.bar
          span.annot Small
        | Small board mounts

      p Mounts sized for Baldrick Pixel Board S and other small-form-factor boards.

      .stl-card#skadis-small
        .stl-head
          div
            h3 IKEA SKÅDIS Mount
            p.stl-by Designed by Ianson Design
            p A clean, low-profile mount that attaches a Baldrick Pixel Board S to an IKEA SKÅDIS pegboard — ideal for desks, workshops, and maker stations.
          = link_to 'https://makerworld.com/en/models/2969546-baldrick-pixel-board-s-ikea-skadis-mount', class: 'btn btn-solid btn-sm', target: '_blank', rel: 'noopener' do
            | View on MakerWorld
            span.ar →
        figure.figure
          .fimg
            = image_tag 'stl-skadis-small.jpg', alt: 'Baldrick Pixel Board S on IKEA SKÅDIS mount'

    section#medium
      h2
        span.hk
          span.bar
          span.annot Medium
        | Medium board mounts

      p Mounts for medium Baldrick boards — the same footprint as many common smart receivers.

      .stl-card#skadis-medium
        .stl-head
          div
            h3 IKEA SKÅDIS Mount
            p.stl-by Designed by Ianson Design
            p A clean, low-profile mount that attaches a medium Baldrick board to an IKEA SKÅDIS pegboard — ideal for desks, workshops, and maker stations.
          = link_to 'https://makerworld.com/en/models/2969518-baldrick-pixel-board-m-ikea-skadis-mount', class: 'btn btn-solid btn-sm', target: '_blank', rel: 'noopener' do
            | View on MakerWorld
            span.ar →
        figure.figure
          .fimg
            = image_tag 'stl-skadis-medium.jpg', alt: 'Medium Baldrick board on IKEA SKÅDIS mount'

      .stl-card#greg-mount
        .stl-head
          div
            h3 Original Baldrick Mount
            p.stl-by Designed by Greg Macaree
            p This mount has breakout clips and is designed to fit on a Meanwell RS320 power supply.
          = link_to '/img/stls/RSP-320-Baldrick.stl', class: 'btn btn-solid btn-sm' do
            | Download STL
            span.ar ↓
        figure.figure
          .fimg
            = image_tag 'stl-greg.png', alt: 'Baldrick Mount Default'

      .stl-card#pi-buck-mount
        .stl-head
          div
            h3 Pi + Buck Converter Mount
            p.stl-by Designed by Stephen Parberry
            p This mount allows the addition of a Raspberry Pi and Buck Converter to the power supply unit.
          = link_to '/img/stls/Pi-Buck-Baldrick.stl', class: 'btn btn-solid btn-sm' do
            | Download STL
            span.ar ↓
        figure.figure
          .fimg
            = image_tag 'stl-stephen.jpg', alt: 'Baldrick Mount Pi and Buck Converter'

      .stl-card#double-stack
        .stl-head
          div
            h3 Double Stack Meanwell Mounts
            p.stl-by Designed by Matt Connolly
            p Hi all, I needed to stack 2 RSP-320's having each one power a side of the Baldrick8 so I've designed these rails with a bend in them so you can still use the standard RSP Baldrick mounting plate.
          = link_to '/img/stls/Baldrick_Matt.zip', class: 'btn btn-solid btn-sm' do
            | Download ZIP
            span.ar ↓
        figure.figure
          .fimg
            = image_tag 'stl-matt.jpg', alt: 'Baldrick Mount Double Stack'

    section#large
      h2
        span.hk
          span.bar
          span.annot Large
        | Large board mounts

      p Mounts for Baldrick17 and other large-form-factor boards.

      .stl-card#skadis-large
        .stl-head
          div
            h3 IKEA SKÅDIS Mount
            p.stl-by Designed by Ianson Design
            p A clean, low-profile mount that attaches a Baldrick17 (Pixel Board L) to an IKEA SKÅDIS pegboard — ideal for desks, workshops, and maker stations.
          = link_to 'https://makerworld.com/en/models/2969567-baldrick-pixel-board-l-ikea-skadis-mount', class: 'btn btn-solid btn-sm', target: '_blank', rel: 'noopener' do
            | View on MakerWorld
            span.ar →
        figure.figure
          .fimg
            = image_tag 'stl-skadis-large.jpg', alt: 'Baldrick17 IKEA SKÅDIS mount'

      .stl-card#b17-mount
        .stl-head
          div
            h3 Baldrick17 Mount
            p.stl-by Designed by Greg Macaree
            p This mount includes both the Baldrick17 mount and 2 Meanwell stackers for a complete mounting solution.
          .stl-dl-btns
            = link_to '/img/stls/b17-mount.3mf', class: 'btn btn-solid btn-sm' do
              | Mount
              span.ar ↓
            = link_to '/img/stls/b17-stacker.3mf', class: 'btn btn-line-light btn-sm' do
              | Stackers
              span.ar ↓
        figure.figure
          .fimg
            = image_tag 'stl-b17.JPG', alt: 'Baldrick17 Mount'

    section#share-yours
      h2
        span.hk
          span.bar
          span.annot Share yours
        | Community contributions

      p We're always excited to see what our community creates! If you've designed a mount, enclosure, or accessory for Baldrick boards, we'd love to feature it here.

      .callout.info
        span.ic
          svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"
            path d="M4 12v8h16v-8M12 3v12m0 0l-4-4m4 4l4-4"
        div
          span.lbl Share your design
          p.bd
            | Have you created a custom mount or enclosure?
            = link_to ' Contact support', support_path(anchor: 'hardware-support')
            |  and we'll help showcase it.

      .pullquote
        span.qm “
        blockquote A huge thank you to Greg Macaree, Stephen Parberry, Matt Connolly, Ianson Design, and all the other community members who have shared their designs.
        cite — The Baldrick team

section.cta
  .wrap
    h2 Need the right footprint first?
    p Check board dimensions before you print — mounting holes are M3, not negotiable.
    .cta-btns
      = link_to fun_stuff_board_dimensions_path, class: 'btn btn-bone' do
        | Board dimensions
        span.ar →
      = link_to fun_stuff_path, class: 'btn btn-clear' do
        | All fun stuff
